Resolves #76.

Add emergency stop flag for ethereum relayer contract which when activated halts the bridge message propagation (effectively halts the bridge).

@reviewer-or-team

Patterns like this now work:

```python
@dataclass(frozen=True)
class Container[T]:
    a: T

tyro.cli(
    Container[Container[bool] | Container[Literal["1", "2"]]]
)
```

Also improved matching logic when the `default=` argument is specified.

We made the number of go routines that pull events from the queue configurable. 

related: https://github.com/owncloud/ocis/issues/10259

@kobergj I set the default to 10 to make configuring the amount of required memory easier. In kubernetes we can then set the memory request lower than `ANTIVIRUS_MAX_SCAN_SIZE` (memory limit to `ANTIVIRUS_WORKERS`*`ANTIVIRUS_MAX_SCAN_SIZE`)
